# ── Moodle Backups ──
# build_mbz.py output. Regenerate with `python pipeline/build_mbz.py --course <dir>`.
# Each build embeds a fresh timestamp + random ids, so committing churns a large
# binary. The reference backup under docs/mbz_reference/ is tracked deliberately.
/courses/**/*.mbz
